 "# ADR-2607021800\n\n**Status**: accepted **Date**: 2026-07-02\n\n## Decision\n\n1. 70-tools/bmc/collect.bb: Cloudflare GraphQL (httpRequests1dGroups 7d /\n   workersInvocationsAdaptive 7d) + Stripe (subscriptions/charges) + health を\n   90-docs/business/metrics/<product>.edn へ集計数値のみ書く。creds は\n   env → Keychain gftd.cf / 1Password STRIPE_SECRET_KEY。秘密はファイルに書かない。\n2. operating cadence: collect → react loop (全 product) → canvas md → score md。\n3. 実測 facts 改訂の要点: gftd.ai 422,889 req/7d・uniques 4,644 (apex 3/2/4)、\n   murakumo worker 158,768 inv/7d (3/-/5)、etzhayyim 136,214 req + 85,862 inv\n   (launched 4)、aozora.app 14,313 req・PV 6,960 (3/2/4)、yoro workers 1,673\n   inv/7d で「設計のみ」を訂正 (2/1/3)、manimani.cloud 443 req (launched 3)、\n   kotobase Stripe active subs 0 (revenue 1 据置)、itonami.cloud 6 req (据置)。\n4. スコア: yoro 52/40、murakumo 64/52、aozora 64/47、apex 60/45、\n   etzhayyim 64/60(参考)、kotobase 76/58、manimani 56/43、itonami 56/43。\n   validation 全 0・revenue 0–1 が引き続き律速。\n\n## Consequences\n\n(+) facts が実測根拠つき、canvas に実測観測が ledger 経由で蓄積。\n(−) Keychain StripeCLI 鍵は期限切れ (1Password が有効)。定期運転は未設定。\nペアの .md が正。"}
